			"notes": "(Still need to figure out what the best way to post releases is)\n\nReworked everything.\n\nAll features:\n\nDisabled Rockets\n\nAdded Grace Periode\nAdded Midflight boost (Need to use Rocket with Star/Explosion effect)\nAdded config options for Tick periode and Strength\nCampfires now boost\n\nHaybales give an extra boost\nGrids give extra boost\nWorks either Linear based on height (Closer = Stronger)\nconfig options for strength, and height detection\nSoul Campfires now pull\n\nHaybales give an extra pull\nGrids give extra pull\nWorks either Linear based on height (Further = Stronger)\nconfig options for strength, and height detection\nAdded Drag\n\nControllable by using Shift\nAlso added Airdrag based on world height (off by default)\nAdded Elytra Bounce (Experimental)\n\nSort of bunny hopping? Still kinda broken, might help with hitting the ground to hard. Hold space to use.\nVisuals and Sounds\n\nBare bones versions for Server side. All player will see these\nAdded a more Rich version when using the mod on Both Client and Server (CLIENT IS PURELY OPTIONAL)\nClient Side, Colored Smoke, Based on Firework data\nRiptide Nerf\n\nNerfed the use of the Riptide Enchantment by adding a Cooldown to it. So you can't spawn it during flight.\nCooldown instant resets when you land, otherwise 600 Tick cooldown. (Configureble)\nYACL Support\n\nClient side has YACL support for easy configs\nDebug Features in both the Config and in Server Commands. These commands toggle the Config options. (Not protected yet, any player can currently activate debug options). BUT there is an option to toggle this commands off in the Config.\n\nAlso, Accessories Compat!\n\n\n\n---\n\n\nVersion Notes\n\n1.21.4 - Nothing to Note\n1.21.5 - Accessories seems broken (their mod), but it should work.\n1.21.6 - No Accessories\n1.21.7 - No Accessories\n1.21.8 - Accessories Support\n1.21.9 - YACL seems broken? Use version 3.8.0 of YACL\n1.21.10 - Accessories Support. (1.21.9 + 1.21.10 use the same .jar)\n1.21.11 - No Accessories"
		}
